  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Construction of Shelter Houses for Flood Effected</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan just experienced one of the most devastating floods in its history.The heavy monsoon rains were hit several districts of Balochistan. More than 710 deaths and more than 1500 people have been injured when the walls and roofs of dozens of houses collapsed due to flash-floods. Thousands of people with their families are still roofless. Millions of people are still exposed to floodwaters or living close to flooded areas. Many families are still living in makeshift tents alongside the road.</narrative>
  </description>
